:: Act3_School_MEP {"position":"900,1700","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
<<set $currentLocation to "mep_space">>
<<set $activeMap to "Highschool Ground">>
<</nobr>>

<h2>GROUND FLOOR — MEP MECHANICAL SPACE</h2>

<div style="margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">
    <img src="image/Act3_Timberline/mep.gif" style="max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid #333;">
</div>

Mechanical, electrical, and plumbing maintenance room. Pipes groan overhead as the generator vibrates through the concrete.

<<if not $looted_mep>>
    <div class="choice-menu">
        <button>
            <<link "Search the generator workbench">>
                <<addTime 5>>
                <<set $looted_mep to true>>
                <<run setup.addItem("Fuse", 1)>>
                <<run setup.addItem("Multi-Tool", 1)>>
                <<goto "Act3_School_MEP">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-gold);">[LOOT]</b> Found 1x Fuse, 1x Multi-Tool.</span>
        </button>
    </div>
<<else>>
    The electrical workbench is cleared.
<</if>>

<br><br>
<div class="choice-menu">
    <button>
        <<link "🚪 Exit MEP Space to Locker Room [SOUTH]">>
            <<goto "Act3_School_LockerRoom">>
        <</link>>
    </button>
</div>